            0.186
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "But there are no tokens in the bag, because we start with an empty bag. Just as in the case of subtraction, to remove 2 positives from an empty bag, we need to first place 2 zero pairs inside and then remove the 2 positives. We need to do this 4 times."
            }
          ]
