        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.387,
            0.845,
            0.425
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "After removing the positives, 8 negatives are left in the bag. This is – 8. This shows that (– 4) × 2 = – 8."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.432,
            0.148,
            0.458
          ],
          "content": [
            {
