            0.111,
            0.434,
            0.846,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ What happens when both the integers in the multiplication are negative? How do we model (–4) × (–2) with tokens?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.48,
            0.847,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For (– 4) × (– 2), we need to remove 2 negatives from the bag 4 times. Since there are no red tokens in the bag, we need to place 2 zero pairs and remove 2 negatives, and we need to do this 4 times."
            }
          ]
        },
